    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE JOURNEY THROUGH TIME BEGINS RIGHT NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/7c0d4e837696739ff6a14ec84dc56c73.poster.avif?t=1744775420\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/7c0d4e837696739ff6a14ec84dc56c73.webm?t=1744775420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/7c0d4e837696739ff6a14ec84dc56c73.mp4?t=1744775420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only Down: Gravitation Up</strong> is a game that will offer you a completely new take on the \u00ab<strong>Only Up</strong>\u00bb genre!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILL A FAN BLOW YOU AWAY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/7d694e2bebcd5bdd4d780c868c91fdd4.poster.avif?t=1744775420\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/7d694e2bebcd5bdd4d780c868c91fdd4.webm?t=1744775420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/7d694e2bebcd5bdd4d780c868c91fdd4.mp4?t=1744775420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wrong step is enough for everything to start over! Show your agility and ingenuity to avoid the fans and not be thrown back to the very beginning of the evolutionary path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT\u2019S TIME TO EVOLVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/02443e00ce18b3f3d3b33430ac14ea58.poster.avif?t=1744775420\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/02443e00ce18b3f3d3b33430ac14ea58.webm?t=1744775420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/02443e00ce18b3f3d3b33430ac14ea58.mp4?t=1744775420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each stage you complete, your character will go through stages of evolution: from prehistoric man to a representative of modern times. Will you be able to overcome all difficulties and reach perfection?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new and exciting game mechanics in the style of \u00abreverse\u00bb Only Up;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more than two hours of gameplay;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >various difficulty levels;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique historical characters and locations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >detailed design: day and night cycle, high-quality character animation.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>THE JOURNEY THROUGH TIME BEGINS RIGHT NOW!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/7c0d4e837696739ff6a14ec84dc56c73.poster.avif?t=1744775420\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/7c0d4e837696739ff6a14ec84dc56c73.webm?t=1744775420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/7c0d4e837696739ff6a14ec84dc56c73.mp4?t=1744775420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Only Down: Gravitation Up</strong> is a game that will offer you a completely new take on the \u00ab<strong>Only Up</strong>\u00bb genre!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>WILL A FAN BLOW YOU AWAY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/7d694e2bebcd5bdd4d780c868c91fdd4.poster.avif?t=1744775420\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/7d694e2bebcd5bdd4d780c868c91fdd4.webm?t=1744775420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/7d694e2bebcd5bdd4d780c868c91fdd4.mp4?t=1744775420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One wrong step is enough for everything to start over! Show your agility and ingenuity to avoid the fans and not be thrown back to the very beginning of the evolutionary path.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>IT\u2019S TIME TO EVOLVE!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/02443e00ce18b3f3d3b33430ac14ea58.poster.avif?t=1744775420\" width=600 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/02443e00ce18b3f3d3b33430ac14ea58.webm?t=1744775420\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3343850/extras/02443e00ce18b3f3d3b33430ac14ea58.mp4?t=1744775420\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With each stage you complete, your character will go through stages of evolution: from prehistoric man to a representative of modern times. Will you be able to overcome all difficulties and reach perfection?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >new and exciting game mechanics in the style of \u00abreverse\u00bb Only Up;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >more than two hours of gameplay;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >various difficulty levels;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >unique historical characters and locations;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >detailed design: day and night cycle, high-quality character animation.</p></li></ul>",
